{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13d5_level_act13d5_08_end","groupId":"act13d5","stageId":"act13d5_08","title":"商業聯合","storyCode":"MN-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"99a6e900f44eb1edd91eee56e9a5e7aa3e4cca3bd567f49163ac349ae72911f2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔 8下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"觀眾席上有一位老人。\n這位老人對騎士競技一點都不感興趣，但為了討孫子的歡心，他還是托人買了兩張票，來看這場在報紙和電視裡被大肆宣傳的比賽。\n他皺眉，他感歎，他不知為何，這種薩卡茲人對年輕庫蘭塔的當眾處刑能夠受到歡迎。\n他並沒有覺得哪裡是錯的，因為他也是一名騎士，沒有貴族地位的征戰騎士。他只是在唾棄這場比賽，或者是薩卡茲人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"但是場上突然亮起了光芒，老人想起了，這個騎士是臨光家的小女兒。\n真可惜啊，他這樣感慨道，然後注視著那道光。在他注視著光芒的同時，觀眾席上極少數的卡西米爾人，同時想起了一個故事。\n故事發生在林河湖畔之外，要塞與城牆組成的衛戍之地。\n每逢黑夜降臨，炬火連成一片，征戰騎士的盔甲在月光下熠熠生輝，銀槍的鋒刃指向黑暗中蠢蠢欲動的敵人。\n那些無情的侵略者，使得天空變色的萊塔尼亞人遮蔽了月光，烏薩斯駭人的軍隊碾過了城牆。\n數座城邦被屈辱地帶往烏薩斯的國境，防線一退再退，“銀槍”成了那些戰爭販子嘲弄騎士的一個笑話。\n直到退無可退的城邦外圍，直到荒蕪疆土上最後的防線——\n——在卡西米爾最後的陣地，出現了一位金髮的老天馬。\n烏薩斯人在戰爭中首次敗退的那個黎明，卡西米爾遙遠的地平線上，升起了兩個太陽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"光。\n光沒有消散，光霧彌漫，將恐懼驅逐。\n此時此刻，太陽也已頷首，迎接這位歸鄉的騎士。\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n......瑪莉婭。\n站起來，瑪莉婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......姐姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"瑪莉婭。\n你長大了，你做得很好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"不......那不是瑪莉婭的法術......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"恰爾內先生！剛才我們接到了——無胄盟守衛的通知！有一道光從競技場西北方向一公里處撞進了競技場！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"速度很、很快！而且根本看不清那到底是什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"......恐怖襲擊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企業員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不像是武器，是一個人，是一個庫蘭塔，但是這種速度，只可能是最頂級的騎士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"這不可能......光芒......難道......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎.......敵人在哪兒？光太亮，看不清......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凋零騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":"任務，就要執行到底。不管是誰——先殺了目標！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然.....用拳頭就能讓我雙腳離地......？什麼人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"骯髒的法術......備受折磨的薩卡茲感染者，“騎士”怎該是這副模樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......真的是姐姐？我沒有昏過去看到幻覺嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，瑪莉婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......姐姐......你為什麼.....才回來啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":".....礙事！殺掉她們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"不，想都別想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"怎......為什麼砍不動她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凋零騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":"......她的光連成了一片，她壓制了我們的法術，後退，我來解決她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"在光芒中登場的——在光芒中登場的毫無疑問，是——是——是耀騎士！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"這是怎麼回事！？本該被驅逐的耀騎士竟然在此刻重回賽場！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"（喂！快去找發言人，這是什麼情況！？什——啊？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"雖、雖然不合規則！但這根本無關緊要！為了救下妹妹，冒著危險返回卡西米爾的耀騎士！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"截然不同的魄力！截然不同的氣勢！面對兩位來自地獄般的騎士依舊毫不畏懼！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們為耀騎士——歡呼吧！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......瑪嘉烈？那個拿著盾的騎士，是耀騎士......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她、她為什麼要回來卡西米爾......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"我都認不出來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"......是她，她這些年......她經歷了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"耀騎士，那個意氣風發的瑪嘉烈......她回來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......你就不能乖乖讓開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是，不拼命不行了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果可以的話，我倒希望你們別這麼拼命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"再說一遍，你們無能為力，我的宗旨是除了必須要幹掉的，其他人得過且過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"只要別往競技場的方向走，至少你們還能活命——嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"——視野變亮了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！老弗，看那邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"那個光......那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"是臨光老爺......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個強度，不太像是瑪莉婭之前展現的法術，該不會.....）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"（可......兩位青金欸......不至於吧......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"別玩了，小天馬，收隊開溜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"耀騎士都已經衝進去了，你還在門外攔著，沒多大意義了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"我大致猜到什麼情況了......但你們兩個一起還能失手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"別這樣懷疑上位者啊，小天馬，本來董事會給我們的任務就只是“看住耀騎士”，又沒說一定要打......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來想的是，就算要打，有那個臭臉和我聯手，也不算什麼難事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"不過稍——微出了點意外情況，首先是耀騎士本人好像變強了那麼一點......其次是，她身邊多了幾個不好對付的傢伙，很麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......如果讓你們都覺得麻煩，那可以不用特地告訴我喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，差點忘了，特地來通知你就是因為這個，目標按照現在的行動路線往前走會和你撞上——啊，好像來不及了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，千萬別動手，自求多福吧，小白金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？等等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"真是，他們在搞什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"難道是瑪恩納？不對......他應該一直待在他的辦公室裡......那會是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"（什、什麼？剛才那是......藍色的影子？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"老弗......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？這種感覺我還真沒有過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......別亂動，輕聲呼吸，看好四周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"（就像被什麼抓住了一樣......讓他們兩個都覺得麻煩的話......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，來了嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"白角持劍的薩卡茲停下了腳步，她輕聲呼吸，她抬起眼眸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，這種的當然很麻煩啊......壓根就不是騎士啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"讓她們過去吧，反正她們也沒寫在目標名單上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲，還走得動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的......那裡，很亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"是臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們跟上吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是的，今天是什麼日子啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那個薩卡茲......和瑪嘉烈認識？什麼情況......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是瑪嘉烈！老弗！瑪嘉烈回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......別大呼小叫的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在......我們呢，還要繼續嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"別那麼盯著我啊......你們撿回一條命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"既然任務撤銷了，我也沒理由繼續攔著你們了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"你們撿回一條命喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"想走就走？站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"老弗！先去競技場，別管她們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁......無胄盟......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type