ype":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"她不會有事的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒見那樣的耀騎士失敗過哪怕一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"那個孩子，和臨光很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是她的妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......真是個可愛的小騎士，和她真像。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凋零騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":"......箭矢......盡了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——！你的法術！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"他用法術做箭......我會擋住的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，剩下的交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凋零騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":"穿不透——這該死的光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"......觀眾們安靜下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪嘉烈並不佔優勢，那兩個薩卡茲很強......而且配合完美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但為什麼我完全不覺得瑪嘉烈會輸......甚至不覺得她有一絲一毫的劣勢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"她的技巧讓人沉迷......她的神態那麼沉穩，光芒卻更加昂揚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我想起臨光老爺還年輕的時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不可思議！完全不可思議！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪嘉烈的戰錘每一次揮舞，綻放出的光彩就能驅散敵人的法術！耀騎士踏步留下的龜裂處都溢滿光芒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"這是怎樣耀眼的源石技藝！這是怎樣的戰鬥技巧！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"這才是冠軍水準！真正的騎士實力——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊......傷口，沒那麼痛了......這也是姐姐的法術嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（那樣的攻防戰裡，還能顧及到我——）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——！我的錘竟然會被......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有武器，就用手，我要撕裂你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凋零騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":"殺了她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"姐姐露出了很奇怪的表情，那是一種......悲憫？\n因為這兩個薩卡茲的行為？因為他們被稱作騎士？還是因為......他們的遭遇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......瑪莉婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"援護就交給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"動手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凋零騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"懺悔吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士&凋零騎士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"此時此刻，賽場已經陷入死寂。\n沒有人意識到比賽已經結束，沒有騎士在誇耀勝利，也沒有失敗者的痛聲長嚎。\n腐敗的薩卡茲跪倒在地——他們沒有倒下，耀騎士亦沒有乘勝追擊。\n她居高臨下地看著兩個薩卡茲，而後單膝跪地，伸出了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲沒有回應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不該放棄自己的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"仿佛不甘向兩個少女俯首一般，他們再不吐一字，也再無力站起。\n耀騎士轉過了身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"欸、欸......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我們贏了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"誰能相信自己的眼睛！誰能相信自己的眼睛！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是我也無法相信！突然殺入比賽的耀騎士！！默許了這一切行為的騎士協會！！天呐，我，這——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是我漫長的解說生涯也沒有見過這種情況！！雖然不知道國民院會如何處理這次亂入，但這並不影響眼下的勝利！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"（莫布先生。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"（......哎唷，您總算來了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"我深感榮幸能為大家宣佈！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"（發言人先生，我該怎麼做？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"（承認她。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"勝者是！年輕的奇蹟瑪莉婭！以及，從遙遠的荒野中歸來的，人盡皆知的天馬，耀騎士！瑪嘉烈·臨光！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒錯，就是這樣，莫布先生，我欣賞的正是你這種煽動情緒的本事。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"（穩住現場，會有人來處理的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們為她歡呼吧——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"佐菲婭！？你去哪兒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"馬丁！她們人呢——呃，那、那個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是瑪嘉烈......瑪嘉烈為什麼現在回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但她怎麼說也是被流放者，怎麼不通知我們一聲就這麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，都冷靜點，說不定瑪恩納其實知道這件事......但是現在，我們得先離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光頭馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"記者和觀眾很快就會把出入口堵得水洩不通，我們得找條路——先讓耀騎士回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"耀騎士！！那是上一屆的耀騎士！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遊客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓開，讓開！讓我拍照！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，各位！請稍安勿躁！無論如何，我們都會確保這次比賽按照合法有序的流程進行到底！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"（下一步該怎麼辦！？聯繫不上發言人？蠢貨！去VIP位找他啊——！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！那是，那是鞭刃騎士！鞭刃騎士從觀眾席突入賽場直奔耀騎士而去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"佐菲——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"欸——佐、佐菲婭姑母！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你為什麼才回來！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——她，她剛才是不是扇了耀騎士一巴掌？啊？欸？等等，這也是值得上頭條的畫面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，但是，我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......剛才那巴掌是我替瑪莉婭打的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己的那份就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝謝你手下留情......不過，你剛才用的是右手......是什麼時候的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那不是該在這聊的話題，你突然出現，國民院不會隨便允許被流放者回到卡西米爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在記者和國民院趕來之前，我們得趕緊開溜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"現、現在？可是比賽結果還沒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪還管這麼多！這個人突然衝進來這件事比比賽重要得多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"麗茲，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不用這麼擔心的，好了，攙著我的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩位薩卡茲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，是我的戰友，閃靈，可以幫個忙嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我昏過去了......這是治癒法術？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰......你！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲，你......你！這不可能，你？治療我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你們傷得很重，但不是在這場比賽裡留下的疤痕。藥物留下的痕跡無法根除，你們應當更愛惜自己一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"滾開——別碰我！嘎啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"等......等等，你.......你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"——臨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"那兩位無胄盟的刺客始終盯著我們......現在不是在這裡歡慶勝利的時刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無、無胄盟？你到底——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要逃嗎？臨光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"取得勝利的騎士絕無怯懦逃跑的理由。想要攔，就讓他們試試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光，那邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......是科瓦爾先生和弗格瓦爾德先生。他們是不是發現了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想什麼呢！當然是要準備一條開溜的路線了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他們三人會幫你們擋住觀眾的洪水，不過事後國民院一定會找到你們家裡去的，那時候就只能交給你們自己解決了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——瑪嘉烈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回來了......真好，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一會老地方見，不許遲到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......臨光的家人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"她回家了，我們都能看出她的喜悅，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，給她點空間吧。她可是耀騎士，在這個卡西米爾，又有誰能奈何得了她呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜鶯","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"閃靈","speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","isRemote":false,"text":"一會我們......就先去和阿米婭會合吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"瑪嘉烈抬起了頭。\n她曾經無比厭惡這塊土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......瑪莉婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......該回家了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但這裡，是她的故鄉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......你來了。你身邊那個小跟班呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"......他是下一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......真是殘忍啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"別說了，告訴我答案吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真是乾脆......但你明知道答案，何必要問我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"也許你能活得更好一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"不......也許我會死在前往流放地的荒野上，也許下手的人，就是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許吧，真到那時候可別怪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"你的流放不會過國民院的流程，你今晚就得離開這裡，還有什麼留言嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"瑟奇亞克還有個小兒子，事情發生的時候，他在場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"而我則想請你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發言人恰爾內","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"......讓他永遠沒有說出真相的機會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["閃靈"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["瑪嘉烈"]},{"speakerId":"char_179_cgbird","aliases":["夜鶯","閃靈"]},{"speakerId":"char_204_platnm","aliases":["？？？","白金"]}]}
